// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Everett Daniels 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P808408581" "Everett Daniels"
// ProfessionString :
// DescriptionString :
"P476878075" "Everett Daniels is an idealist who believes firmly in the concepts of right and wrong. He also believes in capitalism. Hoping to strike it rich, Everett became a lawyer, dedicated to fighting the good fight against corporate greed and malfeasance. He's had a lot of success over the years, and he's focused his practice on a particularly heinous set of corporate enemies: those who work with criminals. He works with a number of different heroes, who help him chase down leads that often lead to criminal charges against the companies he's suing. And that makes Everett's job all the easier in court."
// HelloString :
"P1069723761" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>The courts can't do everything. Got a job for you, hero.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P2808169019" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Time for swift justice.</a>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3584572930" "I'm due in court. Try talking to {LastContactName} instead."
// FirstVisitString :
"P2840620893" "Let's get to work."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1498146041" "I don't have any cases tough enough for you. You should help one of your other contacts."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P3781005080" "Aren't you a little busy to be looking for more work?"
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P2862800597" "Sorry, but my next case is pretty sensitive. Maybe when you reach Security Level {Level}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P3822062214" "You have proven trustworthy, my friend. Take a look at my <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>new Enhancements.</a>  And take my number."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P331906709" "You have shown me that you can handle the most delicate cases I have. You'll have to have <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>the best Enhancements.</a>"
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P1111290029" "You will have to decide what is right and what is wrong without me."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P1073878575" "I know a lawyer, Everett Daniels, who's a pretty good guy. He goes after the big corporations and even the government sometimes, but he's usually on the right side of things. He's always got a lead on the Clockwork. Mr. Daniel's practice is in Skyway City."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P499100240" "Choose Everett Daniels"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P581231270" "Everett will get you into the thick of things."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P3254466303" "I know <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>someone</A> who will be of use to you."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P1472477017" "I have a couple potential new <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>contacts</A> for you."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


