// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Hugo Redding 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P3497221929" "Hugo Redding"
// ProfessionString :
"P1925142268" "Physician's Assistant"
// DescriptionString :
"P1546321337" "Hugo Redding is a dedicated physician's assistant who specializes in helping heroes. With the new emergency teleportation systems and regenerative medicine advances, even the most damaged heroes seldom need a full-fledged doctor; a trained PA can handle most of their needs. One of Hugo's duties is to monitor emergency calls and prepare the teleportation systems, and this gives him valuable insight into the various criminal deeds going on in the city. Whenever he can, he likes to help heroes out, pointing them in the direction of crises and potential points of interest."
// HelloString :
"P2426811676" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Want to help save the city?</a>"
// HelloString :
"P2142404860" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>I could really use a hand on this one.</a>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P1848157349" "I'm real sorry, but I'm about to go on shift. Why not talk to {LastContactName} instead?"
// FirstVisitString :
"P1287145420" "I really enjoy working with heroes."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P2457176648" "You've cleared out my cases, {HeroName}. You should see if you can help one of your other contacts."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P792584425" "If I were you, I'd finish some of the work I already had."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P2794026084" "I've got a job, but you're not cleared for it. See me when you reach Security Level {Level}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P4049823233" "You've earned some trust with your actions, my friend. If there's something that ails you, I've got the <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>cure.</a> You may consider me on call."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P1746491623" "After what I have seen I think I can trust you fully. You should take a look at the latest <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>medical devices</a> in my store."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P2459450139" "My info has taken you as far as it can, hero."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P143678455" "You might want to go see Hugo Redding, a physician's assistant who specializes in taking care of heroes. He also moonlights as a reporter for a medical website, so he's always hearing interesting tidbits about the Hellions and the Circle of Thorns. Hugo hangs out in Steel Canyon."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P1855980587" "Choose Hugo Redding"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P2477270389" "Hugo is keyed into the latest medical practices."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P3945391172" "I heard about <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>someone</A> who you should talk to."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P673022618" "I know a couple <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>contacts</A> who could be useful to you."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


