// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Jill Pastor 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1593630569" "Jill Pastor"
// ProfessionString :
"P797671186" "FCC Investigator"
// DescriptionString :
"P96266146" "Like most kids, Jill Pastor grew up wanting to be a hero, but that wasn't in the cards. Jill has had to settle for the life of an FCC investigator, which, in Paragon City, is much more interesting than she could have imagined. Jill tracks down illegal radio broadcasts, and, with so many criminal organizations in the city, it's a big job.  She's found that the best way to get results is to file all the proper paperwork - after she's told a helpful hero about the situation. Of late she's become particularly interested in the Vahzilok, who have become a thorn in the side of the FCC."
// HelloString :
"P3453867521" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>The buzz is bad. Looks like I need a hand.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P4152375610" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>There's a lot of chatter on the airwaves.</a>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3365604273" "I'm real sorry, but I'm super busy. I know {LastContactName} was looking for you, though."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P1267455265" "Sorry, wrong station. Tune in to {LastContactName} instead."
// FirstVisitString :
"P935110258" "I hope you can help me cut through some of the red tape that keeps a lot of airwave pirates on the streets."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P451442091" "You cleaned out all my cases, {HeroName}. You should ask your other contacts if they can use some help."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P1162199245" "You've already taken on a lot of responsibility, {HeroName}. I don't think I can give you another job."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P4107415634" "My next case is classified Security Level {Level}. Let's talk later."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P1387009880" "I like your method of operating, my friend. We are starting to tune in to each other. I've got some <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>new Enhancements</a> in my store. Dial in to me anytime."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P2704060404" "We are definitely tuned to the same frequency now, {HeroName}. I'll open up my whole stash of <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements</a> to you."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P2788600444" "Time for you to find a new station, {HeroName}."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P3594374324" "I suggest you see if Jill Pastor from the FCC has anything for you. She's always looking for heroes to help her out with the Vahzilok. Jill's offices are in Skyway City."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P659122416" "Choose Jill Pastor"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P3049537736" "Jill is very serious about catching the bad guys and is willing to give valuable info to any hero who can get the job done."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P269299385" "I have a <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>friend</A> I want to introduce you to."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P2157220636" "There are some other <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>people</A> who I want you to help, {HeroName}."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


