// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Kyle Peck 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P3449688686" "Kyle Peck"
// ProfessionString :
"P460857195" "EPA Investigator"
// DescriptionString :
"P1955056229" "Kyle Peck is a die-hard environmentalist who realized he could do more good working from the inside than through protest. He's a huge proponent of alternate fuel sources and of any new technology that might change the world for the better. Kyle keeps a careful eye out for any kind of technology that he thinks might prove harmful to the environment. In his experience, the most dangerous technology is in the hands of criminals. The EPA is not equipped to handle those kinds of threats, so he is happy to pass on information to the city's heroes."
// HelloString :
"P2665639556" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>We have some big jobs ahead, {HeroName}.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P1815800563" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>I have some issues for you to look into.</a>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3915397387" "Sorry, sorry, way too much going on right now. But I know {LastContactName} needs a hand."
// FirstVisitString :
"P913844824" "This city needs cleaning up. I hope you are ready to dig in."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1503294986" "You should help one of your other contacts, {HeroName}. Things are going great around here."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P891875268" "If you want my advice, you'll clean out some of your old cases before you go asking for more."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P1870910116" "My next case is classified Security Level {Level}. You should check back with me later."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P917876097" "I am starting to really admire your commitment, my friend. The latest EPA-approved <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>equipment</a> is all in my store. I want you to call if there's anything I can do to help."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P2218564312" "I wish every hero had your dedication, {HeroName}. You have my full support. I have access to some <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>new Enhancements</a> that might interest you."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P192356921" "I appreciate all you have done for Paragon City so far. I want you to move on to helping some other people now, {HeroName}."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P3780093609" "There's an EPA investigator named Kyle Peck who's known for working well with heroes. I'm sure he'd be happy to help you out as well, and, more importantly, I think you could help him against the Vahzilok. Kyle's connections keep him in Steel Canyon most of the time."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P3364101424" "Choose Kyle Peck"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P2152698956" "Kyle is fiercely dedicated. As long as you show commitment to helping Paragon City, you will have a strong ally."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P4260481667" "There is <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>someone</A> I want you to work with."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P2960736811" "There are some <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>people</A> I know who can use your help."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


