// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Tristan_Caine 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Tristan Caine 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1217594356" "Tristan Caine"
// ProfessionString :
"P928588321" "Environmental Activist"
// DescriptionString :
"P103862981" "Born and raised in Paragon City, Tristan is a idealistic young activist who specializes in urban environmentalism. His primary concerns are issues like recycling, clean air, and fighting urban sprawl. He's been in the news more than once, usually as part of a citizens' group dedicated to repairing Paragon City in an environmentally sound manner. He's got a nose for trouble and thinks of himself as kind of a watchdog, always on the lookout for environmental wrong-doers. He's particularly interested in Dr. Vahzilok, who has a reputation for hindering the environmental movement."
// HelloString :
"P720671218" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>I can use your help right now.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P2478257063" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>I have heard about some things I want you to look into.</a>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P811409228" "Sorry, I'm just about to make a call. Go see {LastContactName} instead."
// FirstVisitString :
"P2938816904" "The villains in this city are a danger more insidious than most people realize. I hope you will help me in diminishing that threat."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P2701500552" "Thanks for the offer, but things are good around here. Maybe you can help one of your other contacts."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P3609813956" "You need to finish what you've started before taking on more jobs."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P77803546" "Let's talk again when you reach Security Level {Level}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P57831368" "My friend, your actions show that you're the kind of hero Paragon City really needs. I got my hands on some <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>new Enhancements</a> that might interest you. If you need anything, you have my number."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P441345205" "I believe with full conviction that you are the person I want to work with, {HeroName}. Let me show you some <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>new Enhancements</a> in my store."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P885255219" "It's time for you to focus your attention and assistance toward others, {HeroName}."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P1801010233" "I'd like you to go and talk to my friend Tristan Caine. He's an environmental activist who keeps a close eye on everything that might impact the city's welfare, including criminals. He might have some good tips for you on the Vahzilok. Tristan has a lot of political connections, so he keeps near the city's center in Skyway City."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P2597579396" "Choose Tristan Caine"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P2980419235" "Tristan looks at the big picture. Keep that in mind when you talk to him."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P4036617415" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>Someone</A> I know could really use your help."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P1883377668" "My <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>friends</A> want to meet you."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


