// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Willy_Starbuck 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Willy Starbuck 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P833731425" "Willy Starbuck"
// ProfessionString :
"P2017966815" "Hustler"
// DescriptionString :
"P13644400" "Paragon City has known more than its fair share of con-men and hustlers, making Willy just one more small fish in a very big sea. He's not so much a con-man as he is someone who's always looking to broker a deal. While he skirts the boundaries of what's legal, he seldom breaks the law. He can get you tickets to a sold out concert or deliver a prized toy on Christmas Eve. He sells information, services, and maybe, just maybe, the occasional stolen good. But he's a good-hearted guy and no admirer of serious crime. So he's more than happy to help the city's heroes whenever they ask, especially when they're combating some of the city's more pernicious evils."
// HelloString :
"P1281237409" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>I've got the perfect info for you.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P249104433" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>You'll love the stuff I have lined up.</a>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P788546819" "You want work, go see {LastContactName}. I don't know you."
// FirstVisitString :
"P2781863001" "I will steer you right, {HeroName}. Trust me."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P771583149" "I got nothing for you. Ask somebody else."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P2421286481" "You got a lot of jobs already, {HeroName}. I'm not adding to your worries."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P4047421445" "Yeah, I've got a job, but it's real sensitive. Maybe when you hit Security Level {Level}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P3329650987" "We work great together, my friend.  I've got some <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>cool gadgets</a> in my store if you're interested; seems they fell off the back of a truck. You need something, you can call on Willy Starbuck."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P2574848976" "{HeroName}, you're the best. I want you to have first shot at these <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>devices</a> a friend asked me to unload."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P967722690" "You know all my moves, {HeroName}. Time for us to part ways."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P1958343704" "You ever meet Willy Starbuck? He's a small time hustler, but he knows a lot about the Council, and he's willing to talk. You should stop by and introduce yourself. Willy grifts over in Steel Canyon."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P169434125" "Choose Willy Starbuck"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P2110760530" "Willy has the kind of mind that can lead you right to the heart of trouble."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P2569121945" "I know the perfect <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>person</A> to introduce you to."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P2194128550" "You know what, there are some <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>people</A> you should definitely meet."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


